{"key":"d50cc2b3ed50c1914ff7439f43f314669a15b0ee384e2d48e83b6d0e565a74fb#1","quote":"If the customer swears, stay polite and carry on.","text":"{\"limits\": []}","usage":{"input":663,"output":9}}
